Package: imagefilter
Title: Apply Colour Filters to RGB Bitmap Images
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Lei",
           family = "Zhao",
           email = "lei.zhao@ki.se",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides simple functions for converting RGB bitmap images
    into greyscale, red, green, blue, and black-and-magenta versions.
    Filter functions operate on individual pixels, and a separate function
    applies a selected filter to every pixel in an image.
